{"root":"cambuk","ipa":"/tʃambʊk/","core":"鞭子，指用于驱赶牲畜或惩罚的工具，引申为激励或鞭策。","pos":["名词","动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/tʃambʊk/","zh":"鞭子；鞭打","phrases":[{"t":"cambuk kuda","zh":"马鞭"},{"t":"suara cambuk","zh":"鞭子的响声"},{"t":"kena cambuk","zh":"挨鞭子"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia memegang cambuk di tangannya.","zh":"他手里拿着鞭子。"},{"t":"Kritik itu menjadi cambuk baginya untuk bekerja lebih keras.","zh":"那次批评成了他更加努力工作的鞭策。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"cambuk","ipa":"/tʃambʊk/","zh":"鞭子","phrase":{"t":"cambuk kulit","zh":"皮鞭"},"example":{"t":"Dia mengayunkan cambuk itu ke udara.","zh":"他把鞭子挥向空中。"}},{"w":"mencambuk","ipa":"/mən.tʃam.bʊk/","zh":"鞭打；鞭策","phrase":{"t":"mencambuk semangat","zh":"激励士气"},"example":{"t":"Ayah mencambuk kudanya agar berlari lebih cepat.","zh":"父亲鞭打马匹让它跑得更快。"}},{"w":"cambukan","ipa":"/tʃam.bu.kan/","zh":"鞭打；鞭痕","phrase":{"t":"bekas cambukan","zh":"鞭痕"},"example":{"t":"Punggungnya penuh dengan bekas cambukan.","zh":"他的背上满是鞭痕。"}}],"derSlugs":["cambuk","mencambuk","cambukan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:41:45.060Z","src":"base"}